{"title":"Hawaii mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Hawaii_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hawaii elementary school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Hawaii_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hawaii middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Hawaii_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hawaii high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hawaii_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\">Hawaii elementary school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Hawaii elementary school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Matters&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math Matters (page does not exist)\">Math Matters</a> is a local mathematics contest for the county of Maui.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hawaii_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Hawaii middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Hawaii middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_MathCounts\" title=\"Hawaii MathCounts\">Hawaii MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8\" title=\"AMC 8\">AMC 8</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hawaii_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Hawaii high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Hawaii high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_Mathematics_Bowl\" title=\"Hawaii Mathematics Bowl\">Hawaii Mathematics Bowl</a> is a statewide mathematics contest for the state of Hawaii.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Oahu_Mathematics_League\" title=\"Oahu Mathematics League\">Oahu Mathematics League</a> is a local mathematics contest for the island of Oahu.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maui_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Maui Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Maui Mathematics League</a> is a local mathematics contest for the county of Maui.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hawaii_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit repor